# T_SCRR: the audit log.  It opens unfiltered, newest first; Ctrl-S moves
# into the list, which pages down, to its end and home; Esc goes back
# to the filters.  A record without a table is refused in the form; the
# rows of item 3, then of a station that made none; the help, opened
# from a text field, under which the field's cursor hides until the help
# closes.  The requests are checked by T_SCRR.
S AUDIT
K CTRL-S PGDN
S PAGE2
K END
S LAST
K HOME ESC TAB
T 7
K CTRL-S
S NEEDTBL
T items
K TAB CTRL-Y
T 3
K CTRL-S
S ITEM3
K ESC CTRL-Y STAB CTRL-Y STAB
T nobody
K CTRL-S
S NOBODY
K ESC F1
S HELP
K ESC
S HELPED
K ESC
